.\" Apply the $HEX[] convention per Dave: show binary examples in the toolchain form rather than describing them. DESCRIPTION now works a real encoding, cafe with an acute e giving $HEX[636166c3a9], and names the tools that accept the form on input. EXAMPLES gains three verified runs: an exact encode-decode round trip checked with od -An -tx1 rather than od -c so it does not vary with locale, colon encoding via -S, and wrapping the raw digest an hx _bin expression writes. All output shown was produced by running the commands.
.\"
.\" Revision 1.2  2026/08/29 17:16:00  dlr
